ointer\":\"/steps/0/statement\"}]},\"parameters_and_allowed_inputs\":{\"verdict\":\"FAIL\",\"notes\":\"The source parameters and H001–H004 are the only direct inputs to R001. The contract binds K, p, lam, M with generic group/module instances, but declares H004 : True and conclusion : True. No actual type encodes the complex highest-weight module, highest-weight vector and relations, dimension, arbitrary admissible lattice, or divided-power preservation. The generic M interface therefore does not establish the source's arbitrary-lattice premise; replacing H004 by True loses rather than faithfully formalizes it. The source includes p=2 and lambda=0, but these parameters do not compensate for absent model data.\",\"locations\":[{\"document\":\"spec.json\",\"pointer\":\"/hypotheses/0\"},{\"document\":\"spec.json\",\"pointer\":\"/hypotheses/1\"},{\"document\":\"spec.json\",\"pointer\":\"/hypotheses/2\"},{\"document\":\"spec.json\",\"pointer\":\"/hypotheses/3\"},{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/inferences/0/inputs\"},{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/propositions/3\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/parameters\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/premises/3/type\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/conclusion/type\"},{\"document\":\"type-result.json\",\"pointer\":\"/stdout\"}]},\"representations_and_conversion_obligations\":{\"verdict\":\"FAIL\",\"notes\":\"The source target is M tensor_Z K and its construction proceeds through the localized lattice, reduction modulo p, and scalar extension; S004 requires basis and x,y,h action correspondence. The contract has no representation definitions or shared obligations (representation is merely \\\"test\\\", objects are empty); the sole plan type True provides no module carrier, actions, bases, or conversion maps. Thus there is no demonstrated arbitrary-lattice representation or typed conversion and no proof of basis/action compatibility or endpoint behavior. This is a missing interface, not a difficult unproved bridge.\",\"locations\":[{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/propositions/4\"},{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/inferences/0/argument/3\"},{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/inferences/0/argument/4\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/representation\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/objects\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/shared_obligations\"},{\"document\":\"plan.json\",\"pointer\":\"/representation_notes\"},{\"document\":\"plan.json\",\"pointer\":\"/steps/0/statement\"}]},\"statements_and_local_plans\":{\"verdict\":\"FAIL\",\"notes\":\"The elaborated signature recorded in type-result.json binds K with Field K, p with CharP K p and Nat.Prime p, lam with 0≤lam<p, and a generic additive group/module M; H001–H003 are repeated and H004 is True. The result is True. This is not the source theorem or any nontrivial local obligation. Contract premises H004 and conclusion are True, and plan T001 is True despite mapping to all source steps. There are no conditional statements representing source inferences for assembly to discharge; elaboration verifies only the vacuous type.\",\"locations\":[{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/propositions/3\"},{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/propositions/4\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/premises/3\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/conclusion\"},{\"document\":\"type-result.json\",\"pointer\":\"/stdout\"},{\"document\":\"plan.json\",\"pointer\":\"/steps/0\"},{\"document\":\"plan.json\",\"pointer\":\"/terminal\"}]}},\"findings\":[{\"verdict\":\"FAIL\",\"explanation\":\"H004 has been replaced by True. The actual Lean binders contain no V, complex Lie operators, highest-weight vector, dimension assertion, lattice basis/embedding, or divided-power admissibility. The proposal therefore does not encode the source assumptions about an arbitrary admissible lattice.\",\"locations\":[{\"document\":\"spec.json\",\"pointer\":\"/hypotheses/3\"},{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/propositions/3\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/premises/3/type\"},{\"document\":\"type-result.json\",\"pointer\":\"/stdout\"}]},{\"verdict\":\"FAIL\",\"explanation\":\"Source conclusion P asserts irreducibility of M tensor_Z K. The actual contract conclusion and elaborated Lean result are True, and there is no source-facing theorem type or output map proving P.\",\"locations\":[{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/propositions/4\"},{\"document\":\"source-map.json\",\"pointer\":\"/source_outputs/P\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/conclusion/type\"},{\"document\":\"type-result.json\",\"pointer\":\"/stdout\"}]},{\"verdict\":\"FAIL\",\"explanation\":\"T001 is True while purportedly covering S001–S008. It exports none of the source's intermediate mathematical conclusions, so the plan is not a typed implementation of the accepted argument route and has no meaningful internal hypotheses to discharge.\",\"locations\":[{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/inferences/0/argument\"},{\"document\":\"plan.json\",\"pointer\":\"/steps/0/source_steps\"},{\"document\":\"plan.json\",\"pointer\":\"/steps/0/statement\"},{\"document\":\"plan.json\",\"pointer\":\"/terminal\"}]},{\"verdict\":\"FAIL\",\"explanation\":\"No typed representation or conversion obligations realize the source's M tensor_Z K construction or S004 basis/action correspondence. Empty objects/shared obligations and the placeholder representation label cannot establish these identifications.\",\"locations\":[{\"document\":\"nl0.json\",\"pointer\":\"/inferences/0/argument/3\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/representation\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/objects\"},{\"document\":\"contract.json\",\"pointer\":\"/shared_obligations\"},{\"document\":\"plan.json\",\"pointer\":\"/representation_notes\"}]}]}}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_d